{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A political sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops in first-person battles. Your choices shape society \u2014 and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/ba15f110c835a54190b7ad9fa1ebe2c2.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/V140_616.jpg?t=1751963401\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mold your populace</strong> by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway citizens' Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Institute curfews, rationing, indoctrination centers, or public feasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Watch as policies spark gratitude\u2026 or rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Crush uprisings with propaganda, surveillance towers, mass rallies\u2014or brutal force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/b008e1ef18233a7b2f970895313631ba.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/base_building_616.jpg?t=1751963401\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Construct factories, housing, armories, and surveillance networks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Automate production lines and resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Assign troops to mining, logistics, or police duties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Dictate salaries, healthcare, housing density, and working conditions\u2014all with real consequences for morale, productivity, and dissent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/ee1e8e6243d723a6a861b87c888398d3.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Battlefield_616.jpg?t=1751963401\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead roguelite FPS engagements\u00a0</strong>and galactic expeditions in one seamless loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Arm your battalion with State-approved weapons and policy-driven abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Assault Urslan outposts, recover critical resources, and weaken their hive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Survive or suffer the consequences\u2014lost soldiers, wasted resources, and rebellion risk back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb0fccdfb158eee1b704887d268cba39.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/Coop_616.png?t=1751963401\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rally your comrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Join forces in online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 Share resources, sync strategies, and execute tactical engagements together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2192 True victory demands collective strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1964ba00d85a31b681b282adea0085ee.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pax Autocratica is a <strong>political sim</strong>, <strong>colony sim</strong>, and <strong>FPS roguelite</strong> hybrid. It combines <strong>base building</strong>, <strong>citizen management</strong>, and <strong>first-person tactical combat</strong> in a sci-fi dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or in <strong>co-op</strong>, balancing government policies, resource management, and frontline combat as you fight for the survival of your State\u2014and humanity itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Your decisions are recorded in the annals of history...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rule with compassion, cruelty\u2014or pragmatic brutality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your legacy is the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/02369de7275bfa4e9ef1bb0fed20ac26.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1067360?t=1751963401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/eaf9f9363d8efaee9b68d45c0dbc84e1fe8c53a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751963401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/92db796e767d907a9b824da525e00ffc58aad0de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751963401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/92db796e767d907a9b824da525e00ffc58aad0de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751963401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Ga