 Autocratica is a <strong>political sim</strong>, <strong>colony sim</strong>, and <strong>FPS roguelite</strong> hybrid. It combines <strong>base building</strong>, <strong>citizen management</strong>, and <strong>first-person tactical combat</strong> in a sci-fi dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or in <strong>co-op</strong>, balancing government policies, resource management, and frontline combat as you fight for the survival of your State\u2014and humanity itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Your decisions are recorded in the annals of history...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rule with compassion, cruelty\u2014or pragmatic brutality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your legacy is the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/02369de7275bfa4e9ef1bb0fed20ac26.avif?t=1751963401\" /></div></p>","developers":["Multiverse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/73738db682055a0702a0a84d7dd8a04661aac6b2/header.jpg?t=1751963401","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115748,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie480.mp4?t=1751963399","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115748/movie_max.mp4?t=1751963399"},"name":"Pax Autocratica Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257115748/1acc8e84557c0be6429b72ec423be023de82fde7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751963399","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstati